{"id": "3241942", "revid": "119536", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3241942", "title": "Croatia Open 2025 \u2013 Dublu", "text": "Croatia Open 2025 \u2013 Dublu a avut loc \u00een a doua jum\u0103tate a lunii iulie 2025. \u0218aisprezece perechi de juc\u0103tori s-au \u00eenscris \u00een competi\u021bia de dublu a turneului de tenis de la Hamburg, Germania, jucat pe terenuri cu zgur\u0103. Guido Andreozzi \u0219i Miguel \u00c1ngel Reyes-Varela erau campionii en titre, dar Reyes-Varela a ales s\u0103 participe la Generali Open Kitzb\u00fchel. Andreozzi a f\u0103cut pereche cu Sander Arends dar au pierdut \u00een prima rund\u0103 \u00een fa\u021ba perechii Patrik Trhac \u0219i Marcus Willis."}
